---
import LearnLayout from "../../components/LearnLayout.astro";
---

<LearnLayout
  title="Export & Import — Learn — cntxt"
  description="The planned manual, file-based way to move your workspaces between profiles."
  path="/learn/export-import"
>
  <a href="/learn" class="back-link">← Learn</a>
  <h1>Export & import</h1>
  <p>
    🔴 Planned — not built yet, no date set.
  </p>
  <p>
    A manual, file-based alternative to <a href="/learn/sync">sync</a> and <a
      href="/learn/backup">backup</a
    >: download your Projects and Quests as a file, carry it yourself, and
    import it on another computer or profile. No account and no continuous
    cost either way — it's just a file.
  </p>
  <p>
    The plan is a JSON file for full-fidelity restores, plus plain Markdown
    or CSV for when you just want a readable list of links rather than
    something to import back in.
  </p>

  <h2>Status</h2>
  <table class="status-table">
    <thead>
      <tr><th>Capability</th><th>Status</th></tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Export Projects/Quests to a JSON file</td>
        <td>🔴 Planned</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Export to Markdown or CSV (reference list, not re-importable)</td>
        <td>🔴 Planned</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Import a previously exported file</td>
        <td>🔴 Planned</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</LearnLayout>
